			"notes": "It just adds Mithril, the first material that has been created — as a useful demonstration. It has a full set of vanilla features that I have tested in-game and everything is working as intended. It can be compared to diamond, as a material. It seems ready to stand on its own as a simple mod. If I were to suddenly abandon this, it's simply a mod that adds a new, useful metal and the expected items/features/functions of that metal."
